PROJECT: NAUKRIX.IN — PREMIUM GOVERNMENT JOB FINDER PLATFORM

Act as a senior full-stack engineer, UI/UX designer, database architect, SEO specialist, security engineer, and product manager.

Build a complete, responsive, production-oriented government job discovery and exam information platform named Naukrix.

The website will be deployed using GitHub + Vercel. The planned domain is naukrix.in.

Do not build a generic job listing website. Build an intelligent job discovery platform where users enter their educational qualification, age, category, state, and skills to discover relevant government vacancies and understand exactly how to apply.

The application must be designed for Indian students, government job aspirants, and candidates preparing for recruitment examinations.

